      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "若い頃、兵士として北の砦に務めておった時に\n任務の合間に、木で人形を彫っておったんじゃ。\n砦を囲む、石壁の隙間に隠したんじゃが……\n今でもあるのか、見てきてくれんか？",
        "official_en": "When I served as a soldier at the fort to the north, I'd\nwhittle a wooden doll between missions. I ended up\nstashing it in a gap of stone in the walls around the\nfort. Hmm... Could you see if it's still there?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
