      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あったのか！？　おお……もう１度こいつを\n手にすることができるとは……嬉しいのう！\nわしはジュラ様に憧れおってのう。\nこいつを眺めて辛い仕事に耐えておったんじゃ。",
        "official_en": "Y-you found my statue?! My, I can hardly believe it!\nYou have no idea what it means to hold it again. See,\nI worshipped Jurah, and looking at this statue made\nmy work bearable... Thank you.",
